{
  "number": 63,
  "title": "O Come, Let Us Sing to the Lord",
  "key": "Eb",
  "time": "4/4",
  "tempo": "Moderato",
  "tune": "IRISH",
  "category": "Worship",
  "subcategory": "",
  "lyricist": "Scottish Psalter",
  "composer": "Collection of Hymns, Dublin",
  "sections": [
    {
      "name": "Verse 1",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm/G]O come, [Bb/F]let [Cm/G]us [Eb/Bb]sing [Fm/C]to [Eb/Bb]the [Bb]Lord,",
        "[Bb]Come [Eb/Bb]let [Bb]us [Cm/G]every [Eb/Bb]one",
        "[Bb]A joyful [Bb7/Ab]noise [Eb]make to [Bb7/Ab]the [Gm]Rock",
        "[Bb]Of [Fm/C]our [Eb/Bb]salvation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm/G]Let us [Bb/F]before [Eb/Bb]His [Fm/C]presence [Bb]come",
        "[Bb]With [Eb/Bb]glad [Bb]and [Fm/Ab]thankful [Eb/Bb]voice;",
        "[Bb]Let us [Eb/Bb]sing [Bb7/Ab]psalms [Eb]of praise [Bb7/Ab]to [Gm]Him,",
        "[Bb]And make [Fm/C]a [Eb/Bb]joyful [Cm/G]noise."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm/G]For God, [Bb/F]a [Cm/G]great [Eb/Bb]God [Fm/C]and [Eb/Bb]great [Bb]King,",
        "[Bb]Above all [Fm/Ab]gods, [Cm/G]He [Eb/Bb]is;",
        "[Bb]The depths [Eb/Bb]of [Bb7/Ab]earth [Eb]are in [Bb7/Ab]His [Gm]hand,",
        "[Bb]The strength [Fm/C]of [Eb/Bb]hills [Fm/Ab]is [Cm/G]His."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 4",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm/G]To Him [Bb/F]the [Cm/G]ocean [Fm/C]vast [Eb/Bb]belongs,",
        "[Bb]For [Eb/Bb]He [Bb]the [Fm/Ab]sea [Cm/G]did [Eb/Bb]make;",
        "[Bb]The dry [Eb/Bb]land [Bb7/Ab]also [Eb]from [Bb7/Ab]His [Gm]hands,",
        "[Bb]Its form [Fm/C]at [Eb/Bb]first [Fm/Ab]did [Cm/G]take."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 5",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm/G]O come, [Bb/F]bow [Cm/G]down [Eb/Bb]and [Fm/C]worship [Bb]Him,",
        "[Bb]And [Eb/Bb]kneeling, [Fm/Ab]humbly [Eb/Bb]pray,",
        "[Bb]Come to [Eb/Bb]our [Bb7/Ab]Maker [Eb]and [Bb7/Ab]our [Gm]God,",
        "[Bb]And hear [Fm/C]His [Eb/Bb]voice [Fm/Ab]today."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "meter": "8.7.8.5"
}
